lms. He commands an undead army of skeletons, zombies, banshees and other creatures, stitched together from parts of enemies he has defeated. Between expeditions through twisted catacombs, you expand your underground lair and research secret rituals to strengthen your servants.\n\nUnfrozen's game combines turn-based tactical battles with roguelike structure and RPG progression. Opponents include miners, dwarves and mercenaries who stand in your way. It is single-player and suits tactics fans who like an unusual premise and squad building."}}